SUMMARY:Urban and Spatial Economics PhD Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Series: Trade\, Regional and Urban Economics\nType: PhD Worksho
 p\nTitle: Urban and Spatial Economics PhD Workshop\nAbout: We would like t
 o encourage all PhD students that are working on topics related to urban e
 conomics or spatial economics in a broad sense to submit a paper or extend
 ed abstract to this workshop. Please submit your paper or extended abstrac
 t by October 25th by using the link on this page.\nHosts: Prottoy Akbar & 
 Pablo Warnes\n\nProgramme:\n\n9:00–9:40\nThe time price of a variable sp
 eed limit: evidence from a Finnish motorway\, by Iaroslav Kriuchkov (Aalto
  University)\n\n9:40–10:05\nEconomic Policy Instruments for Spatial Allo
 cation of Offshore Wind: Integrating Environmental Economics and Marine Bi
 odiversity Protection\, by Venla Ala-Harja (University of Helsinki)\n\n10:
 05–10:45\nClimate Shocks and Violent Conflict in the Sahel: The Role of 
 Food Prices (2010–2023)\, by Giulia Tringali (UNU-WIDER Visiting PhD Fel
 low)\n\n10:45–11:00 BREAK\n\n11:00–11:40\nThe congestion and pollution
  benefits of public transit: Evidence from strikes\, by Mikko Viikari (Aal
 to University)\n\n11:40–12:20\nProhibitive on Paper: the Trade Costs of 
 the EU Export Bans on Russia\, by Martta Rautala (Aalto University)\n\n12:
 20 Lunch at Fat Lizard\n\nFull programme: https://www.helsinkigse.fi/media
 /pages/events/urban-and-spatial-economics-phd-workshop3/b15f615ae7-1793965
 127/program.pdf\nEvent page: https://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/urban-and-s
 patial-economics-phd-workshop3
LOCATION:T003\, Aalto University School of Business\, Ekonominaukio 1\, Esp
 oo
URL:https://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/urban-and-spatial-economics-phd-works
 hop3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
